      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Dzień dobry* is hello all day, and *dobry wieczór* in the evening; both are formal. To a friend it is *cześć*, hello and goodbye. Goodbye is *do widzenia* (formal), *dobranoc* at night, and to a friend *pa*, *na razie*, *do jutra* or *do zobaczenia*."
      },
